data: {"model_request":{"messages":[{"content":"","additional_kwargs":{"reasoning_content":"The user wants a Dijkstra algorithm visualization. This matches the ALGORITHM branch.\n\nThey want:\n1. Dijkstra shortest path from node A to all other nodes\n2. Edges: A-B:4, A-C:2, C-B:1, B-D:5, C-D:8, C-E:10, D-E:2\n3. Must show: distance table, current settled node, candidate edges and updates\n\nI need to follow the ALGORITHM branch instructions:\n1. Call plan_visualization first\n2. Immediately call render_algorithm with all steps\n3. Stop\n\nLet me plan the visualization and compute all the Dijkstra steps.\n\nGraph:\n- A-B: 4\n\n\n- A-C: 2\n- C-B: 1\n- B-D: 5\n- C-D: 8\n- C-E: 10\n- D-E: 2\n\nRunning through Dijkstra's algorithm step by step: I'll start with node A at distance 0, then settle it first and explore its neighbors. From A, I can reach B with distance 4 and C with distance 2, so I'll settle C next since it has the shorter distance. When I settle C, I'll update B's distance to 3 (since 2+1 < 4), and I'll add D with distance 10 and E with distance 12 to the frontier. Then I'll settle B and continue processing its outgoing edges.\n\nFinishing the algorithm: settling B updates D to distance 8, then settling D gives us E's final distance of 10. The resulting shortest paths from A are: B=3, C=2, D=8, and E=10.","tool_calls":[{"index":0,"id":"call_c42517f7c19b44b2a6bc5edb","function":{"arguments":"{\"title\": \"Dijkstra 最短路径可视化\", \"approach\": \"Graph visualization with step-by-step Dijkstra algorithm showing distance table, settled nodes, candidate edges with weights, and relaxation updates. Each step highlights the node being settled and its outgoing edges.\", \"technology\": \"SVG/d3\", \"key_elements\": \"[\\\"Graph with nodes A-E\\\", \\\"Weighted directed edges\\\", \\\"Distance table per step\\\", \\\"Settled node highlight\\\", \\\"Candidate edges with relaxation updates\\\", \\\"Shortest path tree\\\"]\"}","name":"plan_visualization"},"type":"function"},{"index":1,"id":"call_51966b425302486496b80d85","function":{"arguments":"{\"title\": \"Dijkstra 最短路径 · A→各点\", \"description\": \"从节点 A 出发，逐步计算到 B、C、D、E 的最短距离，展示每步的 settled 集合、距离表更新和候选边松弛过程。\", \"algorithm\": \"graph_dijkstra\", \"steps\": [{\"description\": \"初始化：所有节点距离设为 ∞，起点 A 距离 = 0\", \"annotation\": \"初始化距离表\", \"kind\": \"graph\", \"graph\": {\"nodes\": [{\"id\": \"A\", \"label\": \"A\", \"x\": 0.15, \"y\": 0.3}, {\"id\": \"B\", \"label\": \"B\", \"x\": 0.45, \"y\": 0.15}, {\"id\": \"C\", \"label\": \"C\", \"x\": 0.45, \"y\": 0.55}, {\"id\": \"D\", \"label\": \"D\", \"x\": 0.75, \"y\": 0.2}, {\"id\": \"E\", \"label\": \"E\", \"x\": 0.85, \"y\": 0.6}], \"edges\": [{\"from\": \"A\", \"to\": \"B\", \"weight\": 4}, {\"from\": \"A\", \"to\": \"C\", \"weight\": 2}, {\"from\": \"C\", \"to\": \"B\", \"weight\": 1}, {\"from\": \"B\", \"to\": \"D\", \"weight\": 5}, {\"from\": \"C\", \"to\": \"D\", \"weight\": 8}, {\"from\": \"C\", \"to\": \"E\", \"weight\": 10}, {\"from\": \"D\", \"to\": \"E\", \"weight\": 2}], \"highlights\": [], \"distances\": [{\"nodeId\": \"A\", \"value\": \"0\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"B\", \"value\": \"∞\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"C\", \"value\": \"∞\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"D\", \"value\": \"∞\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"E\", \"value\": \"∞\"}]}}, {\"description\": \"① Settle A（dist=0）：松弛邻居 B 和 C\", \"annotation\": \"A→B: 0+4=4 < ∞ ✓ 更新\\nA→C: 0+2=2 < ∞ ✓ 更新\", \"kind\": \"graph\", \"graph\": {\"nodes\": [{\"id\": \"A\", \"label\": \"A\", \"x\": 0.15, \"y\": 0.3}, {\"id\": \"B\", \"label\": \"B\", \"x\": 0.45, \"y\": 0.15}, {\"id\": \"C\", \"label\": \"C\", \"x\": 0.45, \"y\": 0.55}, {\"id\": \"D\", \"label\": \"D\", \"x\": 0.75, \"y\": 0.2}, {\"id\": \"E\", \"label\": \"E\", \"x\": 0.85, \"y\": 0.6}], \"edges\": [{\"from\": \"A\", \"to\": \"B\", \"weight\": 4}, {\"from\": \"A\", \"to\": \"C\", \"weight\": 2}, {\"from\": \"C\", \"to\": \"B\", \"weight\": 1}, {\"from\": \"B\", \"to\": \"D\", \"weight\": 5}, {\"from\": \"C\", \"to\": \"D\", \"weight\": 8}, {\"from\": \"C\", \"to\": \"E\", \"weight\": 10}, {\"from\": \"D\", \"to\": \"E\", \"weight\": 2}], \"highlights\": [{\"nodeId\": \"A\", \"role\": \"current\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"B\", \"role\": \"queued\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"C\", \"role\": \"queued\"}, {\"edgeKey\": \"A-B\", \"role\": \"visited\"}, {\"edgeKey\": \"A-C\", \"role\": \"visited\"}], \"distances\": [{\"nodeId\": \"A\", \"value\": \"0 ✓\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"B\", \"value\": \"4\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"C\", \"value\": \"2\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"D\", \"value\": \"∞\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"E\", \"value\": \"∞\"}]}}, {\"description\": \"② Settle C（dist=2）：松弛邻居 B、D、E\", \"annotation\": \"C→B: 2+1=3 < 4 ✓ 更新（原4→3）\\nC→D: 2+8=10 < ∞ ✓ 更新\\nC→E: 2+10=12 < ∞ ✓ 更新\", \"kind\": \"graph\", \"graph\": {\"nodes\": [{\"id\": \"A\", \"label\": \"A\", \"x\": 0.15, \"y\": 0.3}, {\"id\": \"B\", \"label\": \"B\", \"x\": 0.45, \"y\": 0.15}, {\"id\": \"C\", \"label\": \"C\", \"x\": 0.45, \"y\": 0.55}, {\"id\": \"D\", \"label\": \"D\", \"x\": 0.75, \"y\": 0.2}, {\"id\": \"E\", \"label\": \"E\", \"x\": 0.85, \"y\": 0.6}], \"edges\": [{\"from\": \"A\", \"to\": \"B\", \"weight\": 4}, {\"from\": \"A\", \"to\": \"C\", \"weight\": 2}, {\"from\": \"C\", \"to\": \"B\", \"weight\": 1}, {\"from\": \"B\", \"to\": \"D\", \"weight\": 5}, {\"from\": \"C\", \"to\": \"D\", \"weight\": 8}, {\"from\": \"C\", \"to\": \"E\", \"weight\": 10}, {\"from\": \"D\", \"to\": \"E\", \"weight\": 2}], \"highlights\": [{\"nodeId\": \"A\", \"role\": \"visited\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"C\", \"role\": \"current\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"B\", \"role\": \"queued\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"D\", \"role\": \"queued\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"E\", \"role\": \"queued\"}, {\"edgeKey\": \"C-B\", \"role\": \"visited\"}, {\"edgeKey\": \"C-D\", \"role\": \"visited\"}, {\"edgeKey\": \"C-E\", \"role\": \"visited\"}], \"distances\": [{\"nodeId\": \"A\", \"value\": \"0 ✓\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"B\", \"value\": \"3\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"C\", \"value\": \"2 ✓\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"D\", \"value\": \"10\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"E\", \"value\": \"12\"}]}}, {\"description\": \"③ Settle B（dist=3）：松弛邻居 D\", \"annotation\": \"B→D: 3+5=8 < 10 ✓ 更新（原10→8）\\n候选：D(8), E(12) → 选 D\", \"kind\": \"graph\", \"graph\": {\"nodes\": [{\"id\": \"A\", \"label\": \"A\", \"x\": 0.15, \"y\": 0.3}, {\"id\": \"B\", \"label\": \"B\", \"x\": 0.45, \"y\": 0.15}, {\"id\": \"C\", \"label\": \"C\", \"x\": 0.45, \"y\": 0.55}, {\"id\": \"D\", \"label\": \"D\", \"x\": 0.75, \"y\": 0.2}, {\"id\": \"E\", \"label\": \"E\", \"x\": 0.85, \"y\": 0.6}], \"edges\": [{\"from\": \"A\", \"to\": \"B\", \"weight\": 4}, {\"from\": \"A\", \"to\": \"C\", \"weight\": 2}, {\"from\": \"C\", \"to\": \"B\", \"weight\": 1}, {\"from\": \"B\", \"to\": \"D\", \"weight\": 5}, {\"from\": \"C\", \"to\": \"D\", \"weight\": 8}, {\"from\": \"C\", \"to\": \"E\", \"weight\": 10}, {\"from\": \"D\", \"to\": \"E\", \"weight\": 2}], \"highlights\": [{\"nodeId\": \"A\", \"role\": \"visited\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"B\", \"role\": \"current\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"C\", \"role\": \"visited\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"D\", \"role\": \"queued\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"E\", \"role\": \"queued\"}, {\"edgeKey\": \"B-D\", \"role\": \"visited\"}], \"distances\": [{\"nodeId\": \"A\", \"value\": \"0 ✓\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"B\", \"value\": \"3 ✓\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"C\", \"value\": \"2 ✓\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"D\", \"value\": \"8\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"E\", \"value\": \"12\"}]}}, {\"description\": \"④ Settle D（dist=8）：松弛邻居 E\", \"annotation\": \"D→E: 8+2=10 < 12 ✓ 更新（原12→10）\\n候选：E(10) → 选 E\", \"kind\": \"graph\", \"graph\": {\"nodes\": [{\"id\": \"A\", \"label\": \"A\", \"x\": 0.15, \"y\": 0.3}, {\"id\": \"B\", \"label\": \"B\", \"x\": 0.45, \"y\": 0.15}, {\"id\": \"C\", \"label\": \"C\", \"x\": 0.45, \"y\": 0.55}, {\"id\": \"D\", \"label\": \"D\", \"x\": 0.75, \"y\": 0.2}, {\"id\": \"E\", \"label\": \"E\", \"x\": 0.85, \"y\": 0.6}], \"edges\": [{\"from\": \"A\", \"to\": \"B\", \"weight\": 4}, {\"from\": \"A\", \"to\": \"C\", \"weight\": 2}, {\"from\": \"C\", \"to\": \"B\", \"weight\": 1}, {\"from\": \"B\", \"to\": \"D\", \"weight\": 5}, {\"from\": \"C\", \"to\": \"D\", \"weight\": 8}, {\"from\": \"C\", \"to\": \"E\", \"weight\": 10}, {\"from\": \"D\", \"to\": \"E\", \"weight\": 2}], \"highlights\": [{\"nodeId\": \"A\", \"role\": \"visited\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"B\", \"role\": \"visited\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"C\", \"role\": \"visited\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"D\", \"role\": \"current\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"E\", \"role\": \"queued\"}, {\"edgeKey\": \"D-E\", \"role\": \"visited\"}], \"distances\": [{\"nodeId\": \"A\", \"value\": \"0 ✓\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"B\", \"value\": \"3 ✓\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"C\", \"value\": \"2 ✓\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"D\", \"value\": \"8 ✓\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"E\", \"value\": \"10\"}]}}, {\"description\": \"⑤ Settle E（dist=10）：无未访问邻居\", \"annotation\": \"所有节点已 settle ✓\\n最短路径：\\nA(0) → C(2) → B(3) → D(8) → E(10)\\n路径树：A-C, C-B, B-D, D-E\", \"kind\": \"graph\", \"graph\": {\"nodes\": [{\"id\": \"A\", \"label\": \"A\", \"x\": 0.15, \"y\": 0.3}, {\"id\": \"B\", \"label\": \"B\", \"x\": 0.45, \"y\": 0.15}, {\"id\": \"C\", \"label\": \"C\", \"x\": 0.45, \"y\": 0.55}, {\"id\": \"D\", \"label\": \"D\", \"x\": 0.75, \"y\": 0.2}, {\"id\": \"E\", \"label\": \"E\", \"x\": 0.85, \"y\": 0.6}], \"edges\": [{\"from\": \"A\", \"to\": \"B\", \"weight\": 4}, {\"from\": \"A\", \"to\": \"C\", \"weight\": 2}, {\"from\": \"C\", \"to\": \"B\", \"weight\": 1}, {\"from\": \"B\", \"to\": \"D\", \"weight\": 5}, {\"from\": \"C\", \"to\": \"D\", \"weight\": 8}, {\"from\": \"C\", \"to\": \"E\", \"weight\": 10}, {\"from\": \"D\", \"to\": \"E\", \"weight\": 2}], \"highlights\": [{\"nodeId\": \"A\", \"role\": \"visited\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"B\", \"role\": \"visited\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"C\", \"role\": \"visited\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"D\", \"role\": \"visited\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"E\", \"role\": \"current\"}, {\"edgeKey\": \"A-C\", \"role\": \"path\"}, {\"edgeKey\": \"C-B\", \"role\": \"path\"}, {\"edgeKey\": \"B-D\", \"role\": \"path\"}, {\"edgeKey\": \"D-E\", \"role\": \"path\"}], \"distances\": [{\"nodeId\": \"A\", \"value\": \"0 ✓\"}, {\"nodeId\": \"B\", \"valu